<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>Peggesis GON Cyberpunk Dashboard</title>
<!-- Google Fonts for sci-fi aesthetic -->
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@700&family=Share+Tech+Mono&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<style>
  /* Reset and base styles */
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
    background-color: #0d0d0d;
    font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;
    color: #00fff7;
    line-height: 1.6;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }
  /* Neon glow headers */
  h1 {
    font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
    font-size: 3em;
    text-align: center;
    color: #ff00f7;
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff00f7, 0 0 20px #ff00f7, 0 0 40px #ff00f7;
    margin-bottom: 0.3em;
  }
  h2 {
    font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2em;
    margin-top: 2em;
    margin-bottom: 0.5em;
    color: #00ffe7;
    text-shadow: 0 0 8px #00ffe7, 0 0 16px #00ffe7, 0 0 32px #00ffe7;
  }
  /* Sections styling */
  section {
    margin-top: 3em;
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a, #111);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px #222, 0 0 40px #000;
  }
  /* Section Titles with glow */
  .section-title {
    font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2em;
    margin-bottom: 1em;
    color: #ff00f7;
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff00f7, 0 0 20px #ff00f7;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #ff00f7;
    padding-bottom: 0.2em;
  }
  /* Button styles */
  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.8em 1.8em;
    margin: 1em 0.5em;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.1em;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 0 15px #0ff, inset 0 0 10px #0ff;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff00f7, #00ffe7);
    color: #000;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px #ff00f7, inset 0 0 20px #00ffe7;
  }
  .btn-secondary {
    background-color: #222;
    color: #00ffe7;
    border: 2px solid #00ffe7;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background-color: #333;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 15px #00ffe7;
  }
  /* Tables for system data */
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 1.5em;
  }
  th {
    background: #222;
    color: #0ff;
    padding: 10px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #0ff;
    font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 1em;
    text-shadow: 0 0 5px #0ff, 0 0 10px #0ff;
  }
  td {
    padding: 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #222;
    font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.95em;
  }
  tr:hover {
    background-color: #111;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px #0ff;
  }
  /* Neon status indicators */
  .status-indicator {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    margin-right: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px #0ff, 0 0 20px #0ff;
  }
  /* Footer with winged cyber horse motif */
  footer {
    margin-top: 4em;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.4em;
    color: #ff00f7;
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff00f7, 0 0 20px #ff00f7;
  }
  /* Cyber horse SVG animation */
  .cyber-horse {
    display: block;
    margin: 20px auto;
    width: 250px;
    height: auto;
    animation: glow 2s infinite alternate;
  }
  @keyframes glow {
    from { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px #ff00f7); }
    to { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 20px #ff00f7); }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>Peggesis GON + Peggy PCI</h1>
<p style="text-align:center; font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; font-size: 1.4em; margin-top: 0;">
  <em>Cyberpunk Security System with Wings & Winged Horse Motif</em>
</p>

<!-- Overview Section -->
<section>
  <div class="section-title">Overview</div>
  <p>Welcome to the <strong>Cyberpunk Generative Offensive Networking System</strong>. This high-tech dashboard monitors files, network activity, threat signatures, and incident logs, wrapped in a neon, futuristic interface.</p>
  <p><strong>Features include:</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li>Real-time file and network monitoring</li>
    <li>Threat signature management</li>
    <li>Alert handling & incident logging</li>
    <li>Quarantine and restore capabilities</li>
    <li>JSON and text incident reports</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Run with:</p>
  <code>python peggesis_main.py</code>
  <p>Ensure sibling modules are present.</p>
  <p style="text-align: right;">Author: <strong>Dwayne Hans</strong></p>
  <p style="text-align: right;">Course: <strong>CSIA 450 – Documentation Project</strong></p>
  <p style="text-align: right;">Year: <strong>2026</strong></p>
</section>

<!-- Cyberpunk Winged Horse Illustration -->
<section>
  <div class="section-title">Cyberpunk Winged Horse</div>
  <!-- SVG of a neon-winged cyber horse -->
  <svg class="cyber-horse" viewBox="0 0 512 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="glow" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
        <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#ff00f7"/>
        <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#00ffe7"/>
      </linearGradient>
    </defs>
    <g fill="none" stroke="url(#glow)" stroke-width="4">
      <!-- Body of horse -->
      <path d="M256,50 C300,20 340,80 300,120 C340,160 300,200 256,170 C212,200 220,160 256,120" />
      <!-- Wings -->
      <path d="M180,100 Q160,80 140,100 Q160,120 180,100" />
      <path d="M332,100 Q352,80 372,100 Q352,120 332,100" />
      <!-- Legs -->
      <path d="M240,200 L230,250" />
      <path d="M272,200 L282,250" />
    </g>
  </svg>
  <p style="text-align:center; font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace; font-size: 1.2em; color: #ff00f7;">
    Soaring neon wings—speed, power, and agility in a digital universe.
  </p>
</section>

<!-- Monitoring & Control Modules -->
<section>
  <div class="section-title">System Modules</div>
  <h2>Status & Controls</h2>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <th>Component</th>
      <th>Status</th>
      <th>Details</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Threat Detection Engine</td>
      <td><div class="status-indicator" style="box-shadow: 0 0 20px #0ff;"></div>Running</td>
      <td>Monitoring files, network, signatures</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>File Monitor</td>
      <td><div class="status-indicator" style="background-color:#0f0; box-shadow: 0 0 20px #0f0;"></div>Active</td>
      <td>Real-time file scanning</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Network Monitor</td>
      <td><div class="status-indicator" style="background-color:#ff0; box-shadow: 0 0 20px #ff0;"></div>Active</td>
      <td>Outbound connection analysis</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Alert System</td>
      <td><div class="status-indicator" style="background-color:#f00; box-shadow: 0 0 20px #f00;"></div>Operational</td>
      <td>Real-time incident alerts</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="startEngine()">Start All</button>
  <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="stopEngine()">Stop All</button>
</section>

<!-- Threat Incidents & Logs -->
<section>
  <div class="section-title">Threat Incidents & Logs</div>
  <h2>Recent Threats</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>ID</th><th>Type</th><th>Severity</th><th>Source</th><th>Description</th><th>Time</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody id="incident-log">
      <!-- Dynamic entries here -->
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="generateReport()">Generate JSON Report</button>
  <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="generateTextReport()">Generate Text Report</button>
</section>

<!-- Quarantine Management -->
<section>
  <div class="section-title">Quarantine Management</div>
  <h2>Quarantined Files</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Event ID</th><th>Original Path</th><th>Quarantine Path</th><th>Timestamp</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody id="quarantine-list">
      <!-- Dynamic entries -->
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="restoreSelected()">Restore Selected</button>
</section>

<!-- Signature Management -->
<section>
  <div class="section-title">Threat Signatures</div>
  <h2>Signature Rules</h2>
  <form id="signature-form">
    <input type="text" placeholder="ID" id="sig-id" required />
    <input type="text" placeholder="Name" id="sig-name" required />
    <input type="text" placeholder="Pattern" id="sig-pattern" required />
    <select id="sig-severity">
      <option value="critical">Critical</option>
      <option value="high">High</option>
      <option value="medium">Medium</option>
      <option value="low">Low</option>
      <option value="informational">Informational</option>
    </select>
    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Add Signature</button>
  </form>
  <h3>Existing Signatures</h3>
  <ul id="signature-list"></ul>
</section>

<!-- Footer with winged cyber horse -->
<footer>
  <svg class="cyber-horse" viewBox="0 0 512 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="glow" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
        <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#ff00f7"/>
        <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#00ffe7"/>
      </linearGradient>
    </defs>
    <g fill="none" stroke="url(#glow)" stroke-width="4">
      <!-- Body -->
      <path d="M256,50 C300,20 340,80 300,120 C340,160 300,200 256,170 C212,200 220,160 256,120" />
      <!-- Wings -->
      <path d="M180,100 Q160,80 140,100 Q160,120 180,100" />
      <path d="M332,100 Q352,80 372,100 Q352,120 332,100" />
      <!-- Legs -->
      <path d="M240,200 L230,250" />
      <path d="M272,200 L282,250" />
    </g>
  </svg>
  <p>🚀 Soar through neon skies with your cyber horse wings! 🐎🦅</p>
</footer>

